<description>&lt;p&gt;US officials are discussing a military training and demining mission for Syrian forces while a budget shortfall threatens the chemical weapons watchdog’s work in Syria. Israeli forces shelled farmland in Quneitra province and raided southern Syria, wounding Syrian soldiers, and a drone strike in western Sweida injured four Syrian internal security personnel. Syrian security forces arrested suspects after a robbery at a Homs church, including a church guard, and also detained a fraud and sorcery suspect in Rif Dimashq. Survivors of chemical attacks gathered in The Hague to seek justice. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQYTJtZmx1VXI2Q3cyVDR1VlhSUFI2WV9LMnhPdTFma0swdm4xd0pzZEdranA0VnlYTEV5TFNrX05zd1Q3RU9jLVZNcTRaT1g1ZXV4OVE2aVNKOHd1MGE3UHQzZWthcWVPanc3MEFUTDMzclFwTnVGU0tvVVVrbS04R1NnUzVDaDRnS1BPa3B6aHIwenMyZHVTb282U0FHVmhLQ2hPT1JDTmM5d3hXZG1NSDRLckpvNmFx0gG-AUFVX3lxTE83QjBNWEN2WXFXOW9VOTRZUFJZZUZWTVRzaUxqdEhJcHJibU04alNrTUptWDJMSDNzNERHYVNoLXJHc2dKZXpucGY0dXBobF9uYk14QnBEOVFhVkZFUTZzQkJXTlZISlV0WHBRQUhKYkZkdWlsYkVOT1F4dkcwSnhKSmlPc3dxemxBU2t5U1puM2NyUlBROXBWY2tiN3RBZEZFaWFFUzQwSEQ1eHAtYlhxcEN0ZGZSbWVUbjFHNUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNak9UYUZsRmJBU0FMblBvd3pUbThVRGZtVUw4WkF6QzRkRGVxUl9iN1VCTG0zWTFTcGt1cEprM2FmWFM1ZVBIc0lXT1diOXVsUHhEZTJnWEQ2V1hFdlZmYzdlQUotalFoU3FBNG5FcUszX29SSm5tWkoyX184X0o1M2w5YmFWbW5IZmYwT21QMGR6UW82NlhvUXJreUdSazdseEh5WEpmZlR6Ry1fZFJrUFZSTEluMktLZkRNS3NrNGg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE94ZnJWMlZzRHdmZnBvZ2huOVhLbUU2VlNaVXRFek5xRWpmSXRRTVBXdjBGc2F1Sy1fcUI3QkVzOWpZYTNMMzBidW9UdnhWakpLR1E2bkJIVzZRdnU5Wkk0N1FmcW1fTzFzcXV1UEtKUWFyX1l0